The UGREEN LED wire protocol was originally documented by Yuhao Zhou (miskcoo):
https://github.com/miskcoo/ugreen_leds_controller
Reference revision: f0fcd8192abdd92244aba9f6f0d10572f5561380

This project independently implements that protocol in Go and corroborates it
through offline inspection of publicly distributed DXP2800 UGOS firmware.
The upstream userspace CLI is MIT licensed. Its license is reproduced below
in recognition of the protocol and implementation reference. Upstream kernel
source files carry GPL-2.0-only headers; none are included in this project.

The pjrobot/ugreen-leds-truenas project demonstrated userspace activity polling
with hardware blink mode and provided another implementation reference:
https://github.com/pjrobot/ugreen-leds-truenas

UGREEN firmware, binaries, extracted files and disassembly are NOT distributed
in this repository. UGREEN does not sponsor or endorse this project.

